petrus-engine-sqlite
Copyright 2026 Seasoned

This package is a Haskell port of petrus.engine.sqlite, the fenced local
SQLite Engine composition of Petrus (https://github.com/henriquebastos/petrus),
pinned under upstream/petrus (see UPSTREAM.md at the repository root).

Ported from henriquebastos/petrus
