  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

The test suite ports tests/petrus/engine/test_sqlite_engine.py. The interop
driver in test/interop/ and the benchmark in bench/python_bench.py run the
pinned reference from its virtual environment; no upstream source code is
included in this package.
